# React Development Scaffold

A lightweight Docker Compose development scaffold for quickly starting React projects with minimal frontend tooling.

## Stack

- React
- React DOM
- esbuild
- nginx
- Node.js
- Optional ASP.NET Core backend
- Optional PostgreSQL database

## Architecture

```text
Browser
   ↓
Host Port
   ↓
nginx Reverse Proxy
   ↓
Frontend Container
   ↓
esbuild Development Server